Subject: [PATCH] mpl 3.10 get_figure(root=True) and py3.14 warning stack

get_figure(root=True) for mpl 3.10. warn_pandas uses skip_file_prefixes
so py3.14 still records pandas UserWarnings. no fake unused-cmap warn.

